          "source": "wotc",
          "published_at": "2018-07-13",
          "comment": "Myth Unbound\u2019s cost reduction applies after you apply the commander tax. In effect, this reduces the commander tax to {1}."
        },
        {
          "object": "ruling",
          "oracle_id": "83e047ac-aaa9-4bd8-9ea0-49761d39139c",
          "source": "wotc",
          "published_at": "2018-07-13",
          "comment": "Myth Unbound\u2019s cost reduction applies even if you\u2019re casting your commander from a zone other than the command zone."
        },
